            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To [-] Licinius [---]cianus, son of [?], of tribe Palatina, Roman knight, (bearer of) a public horse, who distributed to the Augustales (and) worshippers of the divine house, 500 sesterces [---] and likewise [?] sesterces to them, [---] the Augustales (and) worshippers of the divine house, [---?]</p>
